src/content/stories/aar-the-opm-1-g-gate-loop-mutation-verify-in-the-fix-step-not-the-next-review-ro.mdx:43:Each round ran a security review, fixed the findings it surfaced, and asserted the work was closed. The next round opened by discovering that the closure evidence was hollow, then generated a fresh finding set from the remediation itself. Blocking-finding counts converged, but slowly:
