     3	 * FocusHost — the reading-experience-v2 P0-C inspection controller
     4	 * (ARCHITECTURE.md §3, DIRECTION.md V4). Mounts the one native <dialog>
     5	 * every "Explore thread" / evidence / figure trigger on the essay page
